shairport-sync: 5.6.1 (AirPlay 2, smi11)
nqptp: 1.2.9 (smi11 — must match shairport-sync)
FFmpeg: 8.1.2, minimal static (alac,aac decoders + swresample only)
  sha256: 464beb5e7bf0c311e68b45ae2f04e9cc2af88851abb4082231742a74d97b524c
shairport-sync configure:
  --with-airplay-2 --with-alsa --with-avahi --with-ssl=openssl --with-soxr --with-metadata
chroot runtime (apk): musl busybox alsa-lib avahi dbus libconfig popt soxr
  libcrypto3 libssl3 libsodium libgcrypt libgpg-error libplist libuuid
  gettext-libs libgcc libgomp
